1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,666
Look at the blood vessels.

2
00:00:01,666 --> 00:00:07,486
The afferent arteriole bringing blood in is wider than the efferent arteriole taking it out.

3
00:00:07,486 --> 00:00:11,901
So blood backs up in the glomerulus, and its pressure stays high.

4
00:00:11,901 --> 00:00:14,674
That pressure is what drives filtration.

